  "text": "Get Inspired Pick a Project.\nBrowse real customer projects by upgrade area. Save ideas, then preview styles on your home when you’re ready. DIY-friendly. Support is available if you want it.\nTry the Visualizer Get Project Planning Guide\n\nWe can all do it, this is not a skilled tradesman job, I recommend GenStone.\n\n  Browse Wainscot Projects\n\nEd Desert Sunrise Wainscot\n\n“You guys are awesome… responded to our questions and needs. Great product and easy to install.”\n\n  Browse Interior Projects\n\nMichael Kenai Fireplace\n\n“The easiest product I have ever installed will definitely use it again.”\n\n  Browse Siding Projects\n\n“Courtney… helped me through the process… Installation is straightforward without need of special tools.”\n\n  Browse Fireplace Projects\n\nDenise Kenai Fireplace\n\n“Material was easy to use… a nice way to finish our outdoor oasis… Turned out great.”\n\n  Browse Outdoor Kitchen Projects\n\nDon Coffee Outdoor Kitchen\n\n“GenStone made an amazing difference on the front of my house and was so easy to install.”\n\n  Browse Garage Projects\n\nEd Kenai Garage\n\nSee What’s Possible with GenStone\nReal DIY Transformations • Find Your Next Project.\n\nBrowse real customer projects by upgrade area. Save ideas, then preview styles on your home when you’re ready.\n\nFireplace\nSurround Ideas + TV walls\n\nFireplace surround ideas and TV wall projects that feel DIY doable.\n\nSee Fireplace Ideas\n\nMetal Buildings\nWainscot that Upgrades Curb Appeal\n\nAdd stone or brick wainscot. See real building makeovers.\n\nSee Metal Building Ideas\n\nOutdoor Kitchen\nBackyard Upgrades that Feel Custom\n\nGrill islands, bars, and kitchens that look like real stone.\n\nSee Outdoor Kitchen Ideas\n\nWainscot\nFast, High-Impact Exterior Detail\n\nBig curb-appeal lift with wainscot panels and ledgers.\n\nSee Wainscot Ideas\n\nFoundation Cover Up\nClean Up Exposed Foundation\n\nCover exposed foundation fast with a clean stone look.\n\nSee Concrete Cover Up Ideas\n\nFront Door\nEntry Ideas for Instant Curb Appeal\n\nFrame your entry with stone accents for instant curb appeal.\n\nSee Front Door Ideas\n\nBackyard\nOutdoor Living Ideas\n\nOutdoor living upgrades: kitchens, bars, accents, and more.\n\nSee Backyard Ideas\n\nAccent Wall\nInterior Focal Wall Inspiration\n\nInterior focal walls for living rooms, bedrooms, offices, and TV walls.\n\nSee Accent Wall Ideas\n\nSiding\nBig Exterior Transformations\n\nExterior transformations with lightweight panels and simple tools.\n\nSee Siding Ideas\n\nChimney\nUpdate a Tired Chimney Fast\n\nRefresh an outdated chimney with stone texture and modern color.\n\nSee Chimney Ideas\n\nKitchen\nWarmth + Texture in Key Spots\n\nIslands, backsplashes, and accents that add warmth and texture.\n\nSee Kitchen Ideas\n\nLiving Room\nProjects that Finish the Room\n\nFireplaces, TV walls, and features that finish the room.\n\nSee Living Room Ideas\n\nBrowse All Projects\nExterior or Interior • Filter by Upgrade Area\n\nSearch by Project\n\nSelect Upgrade Area\n\nSelect Upgrade Area All Upgrade Areas\nAccent Wall Backsplash Backyard Bar Basement Bathroom Bedroom Chimney Church Columns Commercial Deck Dining Room Entertainment Center Fireplace Flower Pots Foundation Cover Up Front Door Garage Island Kitchen Laundry Room Living Room Mailbox Metal Building Office Outdoor Kitchen Patio Pillars Pool Porch Retaining Wall Shed Siding Signage Skirting Sunroom Wainscot Water Feature Wood Stove\n\nAll Categories\n#MyGenStoneDIY Exterior Interior\n\nAll Categories\n#MyGenStoneDIY Exterior Interior\n\n&times; Reset Filters\n\nApply Filters\n\n1757\n\nTom’s DIY Home Siding Transformation\nGenStone is perfect for a DIY home siding transformation like this customer did. Take a look at their stunning before and after photos!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nNorthern Slate\n\nKevin O'Dwyer\nGeneral Manager\n\n609\n\nTyler’s Design Living Room Fireplace\nIf you're looking for inspiration for your living room fireplace design, check out this project. Stacked Stone transformed this fireplace!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nIron Ore\n\n289\n\nThad’s DIY Home Exterior Chimney\nFaux stone makes remodeling your home exterior chimney an easy DIY project. In a single weekend, you can transform your home. Take a look!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nStratford\n\n846\n\nDenise’s Faux Stone DIY Fireplace Remodel\nFaux stone is the perfect material for a DIY remodel of your home's fireplace, like this customer's project. Check out the before and after!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nKenai\n\n437\n\nLisa’s Stone Veneer Skirting Under Windows\nStone veneer is a perfect addition to a home remodeling project like this one, which is skirting under windows. See the before & after!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nVanilla Bean\n\n269\n\nTodd’s Stone Veneer Exterior Chimney\nAdding natural stone to your home exterior chimney can be expensive, which is why using stone veneer for your chimney is the perfect choice.\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nIron Ore\n\n741\n\nDon’s Stone Veneer Outdoor Kitchen\nOur stone veneer is perfect for any outdoor kitchen. It is easy to install and cut to fit around your cabinets, refrigerator and more.\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nKeystone\n\nAvery Housley\nProject Coordinator\n\n239\n\nLuke’s Faux Stone Front Door Siding\nOur faux stone is great for homes and businesses, like this front door siding project. Take a look at Luke's new front door siding!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nDesert Sunrise\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/mqH9kpxw8v83vKQg28H7U9.jpg\" data-uuid=\"mqH9kpxw8v83vKQg28H7U9\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 2957\n\nHow Earl Covered His Old Brick Wall\nYou can cover up an old brick wall with GenStone faux stone panels. Watch how Earl, a 79 year old weekend warrior covered up his old brick.\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nDesert Sunrise\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/YGqytLS4NXiA5jtCdHMWQV.jpg\" data-uuid=\"YGqytLS4NXiA5jtCdHMWQV\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 579\n\nRob’s Reclaimed Wood Wall\nWant to add the timeless look of wood to your home? Rob did just that with the installation of his reclaimed wood wall from GenStone!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nAspen Grove\n\nSee GenStone on Your Home\n\nUpload a photo of your home and see how GenStone looks instantly. Explore all colors and styles, discover your perfect design and price your project with just one click.\n\nUpload Your Photo\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/bdh71L1Z1x6mvswBvLR7tZ.jpg\" data-uuid=\"bdh71L1Z1x6mvswBvLR7tZ\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 268\n\nNew Siding for Doug’s Home\nSee how Doug transformed the outside of his home using our stacked stone siding! For fireplace finish ideas, browse GenStone's home siding options today!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nStratford\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/D3s3YWC74hgRsEHsoXsctB.jpg\" data-uuid=\"D3s3YWC74hgRsEHsoXsctB\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 412\n\nTom’s Wainscot Paneling Project\nWainscoting Paneling Project adds Curb Appeal and Value to this Alaska Home. GenStone's Wainscot Paneling Kit is the Best Choice Harsh weather Climates.\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nKenai\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/55K2Y7Q51bAkuEMG3kMcSY.jpg\" data-uuid=\"55K2Y7Q51bAkuEMG3kMcSY\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 102\n\nGreg’s Second Story Faux Stone Accent Wall\nOur faux stone is perfect for an exterior accent wall, like this customer did on the second story of their home. Check out the before & after\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nNorthern Slate\n\nKevin O'Dwyer\nGeneral Manager\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/Nq8bPwc2kQXKQ2LJZ5vknK.jpg\" data-uuid=\"Nq8bPwc2kQXKQ2LJZ5vknK\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 104\n\nStacked Stone Siding, Before and After\nGenStone Stratford Stacked Stone panels complete a beautiful exterior siding remodel. See before and after photos.\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nStratford\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/tBhgLeyUDvF25bDmbxU3R3.jpg\" data-uuid=\"tBhgLeyUDvF25bDmbxU3R3\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 64\n\nChris’ Brick Baseboards\nThinking of making a DIY brick baseboard wall? This DIY brick wall can be installed over the weekend. Read more about this baseboard project.\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nMulti Color\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/mbsDLAU1Hsbddaqyfj8p7e.jpg\" data-uuid=\"mbsDLAU1Hsbddaqyfj8p7e\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 151\n\nDIY Stone Veneer Fireplace\nThe DIY home fireplace is one of the most popular projects with our stone veneer. Check out these before and after photos!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nNorthern Slate\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/9Geu6TAmBVcDskZfhGmnzP.jpg\" data-uuid=\"9Geu6TAmBVcDskZfhGmnzP\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 65\n\nOutdoor BBQ Island\nDIY Outdoor Grill Station, Stacked Stone Outdoor BBQ Island with Grill Station & Bar. GenStone can help you with Do it Yourself Outdoor Island ideas.\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nKeystone\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/1MXFRCeQMz9RXX54s5KN1n.jpg\" data-uuid=\"1MXFRCeQMz9RXX54s5KN1n\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 36\n\nDIY Entertainment Center Ideas\nDIY beautiful entertainment center using stacked stone panels by GenStone. Check out this built-in and other DIY projects to update your home.\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nKenai\n\n<iframe title=\"Sam&amp;apos;s Stacked Stone Breakfast Bar and Niche\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/342462354?dnt=1&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe> 47\n\nKitchen Breakfast Bar\nUpdate your kitchen with a Stacked Stone Kitchen Breakfast Bar and Kitchen Backsplashes do-it-yourself project using GenStone faux stone panels.\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nStratford\n\n<iframe title=\"MyGenStoneDIY - Keith Northern Slate House\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/803171417?dnt=1&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe> 27\n\nKeith’s Faux Stone Duplex Skirting\nYou can improve the curb appeal of your duplex by installing our faux stone skirting around it. The look will impress your tenants.\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nNorthern Slate\n\n2025 Value Builder Handbook\n\nDownload this whitepaper and discover which home improvement projects have the highest return on investment this year including where GenStone ranks with its 153% return on investment.\n\nDownload Now\n\n<iframe title=\"#MyGenStoneDIY - Keystone Bar &amp; Grill by Brent\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/767045735?dnt=1&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"219\" height=\"390\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe> 40\n\nBrent’s Faux Stone BBQ Station\nLooking for a way to improve your grill? Take a look at this beautiful faux stone BBQ station project! The stone veneer brings it to life!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nKeystone\n\n<iframe title=\"MyGenStoneDIY - Annie Desert Sunrise Siding\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/786063328?dnt=1&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe> 42\n\nAnnie’s DIY Faux Stone Home Siding Idea\nYou can easily transform your home siding with a DIY project idea like Annie's using GenStone's faux stone. Take a look!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nDesert Sunrise\n\n<iframe title=\"MyGenStoneDIY - Desert Sunrise Fireplace by Tom\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/771721330?dnt=1&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"219\" height=\"390\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe> 21\n\nTom’s Family Room Fireplace Surround\nGenStone's Desert Sunrise Stacked Stone transformed Tom's family room fireplace surround. Take a look at the video!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nDesert Sunrise\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/embed/v4.js\"></script><img style=\"width: 100%; margin: auto; display: block;\" class=\"vidyard-player-embed\" src=\"https://play.vidyard.com/VXAXbvZDmgaaC5Z41ecPKa.jpg\" data-uuid=\"VXAXbvZDmgaaC5Z41ecPKa\" data-v=\"4\" data-type=\"inline\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\"/> 34\n\nBob’s DIY Wainscoting Pillars & Flowerpots\nBob used our faux stone pillar panels for a beautiful DIY pillars wainscoting project and used his leftovers for flowerpots. Take a look!\nLearn more &rarr;\n\nKeystone\n\nRyan Walsh\nProject Coordinator\n\nLoad More",
